    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the quiet. it's the feeling that i've already lived my life. everything i cared about is gone. my wife, my friends... it's just me and these four walls. i feel like a burden to everyone even just existing. like i'm just taking up space that could be used for someone who actually has a future.",
